{"name":"Shrimp Toast","hex":"#f7c5a0","fetched":"2026-10-13","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"shrimp toast","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A Chinese dim sum dish of small triangles of bread, brushed with egg and coated with minced shrimp and water chestnuts, then baked or deep-fried."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/shrimp_toast"}],"entries":[{"title":"Shrimp toast","blocks":[{"text":"Shrimp toast or prawn toast is a Cantonese dim sum dish from Hong Kong. It is made from small triangles of bread, coated with a paste made from minced shrimp and cooked by baking or deep frying. It is a common appetizer in Western Chinese cuisine. A common variant in the United Kingdom, Australia and Ireland is sesame prawn toast. This involves sprinkling sesame seeds onto the bread before the baking or deep-frying process."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/97/Shrimp_Toast.jpg/330px-Shrimp_Toast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shrimp_toast"},{"title":"Shrimp","blocks":[{"text":"A shrimp is a common name typically used for crustaceans with an elongated body and a primarily swimming mode of locomotion. The name usually refers to decapods belonging to the Caridea or Dendrobranchiata, although some crustaceans outside this order are also referred to as \"shrimp\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b9/Palaemon_serratus_Croazia.jpg/330px-Palaemon_serratus_Croazia.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Shrimp"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Deep_fried_shrimp_mince_toast.jpg/250px-Deep_fried_shrimp_mince_toast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Deep_fried_shrimp_mince_toast.jpg/330px-Deep_fried_shrimp_mince_toast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e8/Deep_fried_shrimp_mince_toast.jpg/250px-Deep_fried_shrimp_mince_toast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ADeep_fried_shrimp_mince_toast.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/PhotoSesamePrawnToast.jpg/250px-PhotoSesamePrawnToast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/PhotoSesamePrawnToast.jpg/500px-PhotoSesamePrawnToast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e0/PhotoSesamePrawnToast.jpg/250px-PhotoSesamePrawnToast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APhotoSesamePrawnToast.jpg%23file"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Vietnamese_shrimp_toast.jpg/250px-Vietnamese_shrimp_toast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Vietnamese_shrimp_toast.jpg/500px-Vietnamese_shrimp_toast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d2/Vietnamese_shrimp_toast.jpg/250px-Vietnamese_shrimp_toast.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AVietnamese_shrimp_toast.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Shippoku_hadosi.jpg/250px-Shippoku_hadosi.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/28/Shippoku_hadosi.jpg/